# Stray binaries from `go build ./scripts/<tool>` run without -o. These tools
# are normally invoked with `go run`, which leaves nothing behind, but a
# `go build` drops a binary at the repo root and two have already been
# committed by accident. Every new program under scripts/ needs a line here.
